zoe-sales: Borealis Retail wants a short POC: streaming receipt ingestion -> structured JSON + a function call to enrich product metadata. They asked for a tiny drop-in SDK example (node or python) and a hosted vs dedicated ballpark for ~45k tokens/day. Any immediate blockers?

ian-presales: Hosted POC OK. Recommend low-latency mode (batching=0) and a trimmed model for sub-250ms SLO. I'll paste a minimal node streaming + function example.

marta-se: Node snippet (streaming + function -> webhook):
```js
const RDW = require('@redwood/inference')
const client = new RDW({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY })
const s = client.chat.stream({
  model: 'redwood-micro-1',
  messages: [{role:'user', content:'Extract receipt to JSON'}],
  functions: [{name:'enrich_sku', description:'map sku -> metadata'}],
  structured_output: {type:'json_schema', schema:{total:'number', items:'array'}}
})
for await (const ev of s) {
  if (ev.type === 'delta') process.stdout.write(ev.delta)
  if (ev.type === 'function_call') {
    // POST to customer's webhook
    fetch(process.env.WEBHOOK_URL, {method:'POST', body: JSON.stringify(ev.payload)})
  }
}
```

zoe-sales: Great. Pricing quick math: 45k/day -> ~1.35M/mo. Hosted list ~ $0.00029/token => ~$392/mo. Dedicated baseline for consistent sub-250ms SLOs starts around $2k-$3k/mo (depending on GPU and region). I'll flag for discounts.

sam-sec: Security: Borealis requires SOC2 + IP allowlist + SSO. For POC enable project-scoped keys + IP allowlist + short TTL. For prod recommend Dedicated or Private with KMS and audit logs. I'll attach the short security checklist to the invite.

infra-bot: infra-bot: RDW-9001 opened to reserve a low-latency hosted test slot. ETA ~24-48h.

ian-presales: Also note: function-call streams can send tool outputs in chunks. Recommend their webhook assemble chunks until a final marker. We'll include a tiny webhook example in the repo.

marta-se: Webhook pseudo-Payload example:
POST /hooks/recv
{ "audit_id":"abc-123","tool":"enrich_sku","payload": {"sku":"SKU1","title":"Blue Shirt","price":29.99} }

zoe-sales: Can we book a tech kickoff Tue 10am PT? Invite to include pre-call checklist + short repo link.

ian-presales: I'll own: 1) trimmed SDK examples (node + py), 2) webhook sample, 3) hosted vs dedicated exact quote.

